7,Folk Music Of Kashmir,https://www.jkartsfoundation.in/post/folk-music-of-kashmir,"October 18, 2024 - The classical music like the Indian classical is based on the mixed Indo-Persian style. Whatever variations there be between Indian and the classical Kashmiri music today, the fact remains that Kashmir throughout its history has remained within the orbit of Indian artistic and cultural influence.",Kashmiri,Indo-European
